      "content": "Hey, so I'm working on a crisis management plan for a tech client. They're getting hammered on social media right now because they haven't made a statement regarding the new [Policy X] legislation. Half our users are calling them cowards for staying silent, and the other half are saying they shouldn't get involved in politics. Can you give me a breakdown of the pros and cons for them issuing a formal statement supporting the policy versus just staying quiet and staying neutral?",
